Description: Combined system monitor
 Terminal-based monitoring tool combining process monitoring,
 disk I/O, and network traffic analysis in a single interface.
 .
 Features:
  * Real-time CPU, memory, and swap usage monitoring
  * Disk usage and I/O statistics
  * Network traffic analysis with packet inspection
  * Process listing with resource usage
  * Historical trends with simple graphs
